   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **On The Southbound** (1 review): On the Southbound leads into Home of the Red Fox, then segues into Sweet Blue Eyed Darling [4]\n- **This Heart of Mine** (1 review): This Heart of Mine segues directly into Dealing Despair [4]\n- My Sweet Blue-Eyed Darlin' is track 3 on the recording [2]\n- Dos Banjos appears as track 7 [2]\n- Dealing Despair is track 11 [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **On The Southbound**: back after 64 archived shows (539 days); rare: 7 archived performances [5]\n- **Brokedown Palace**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2017-12-30.Neumann** (recommended): source not stated; 7 songs; 55 min; rated 1.67/5 by 3 [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2017-12-30.Neumann**: taped by Todd Moore; transferred by Todd Moore; source: Neumann ak 40>lc3>km100> Lunatec v3> sound devices 788t + Neumann km150 >sound devices 788t +Neumann km 130 > sound devices 788t [1]",
